WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.937
Unstructured data does not naturally arrive as a table.

00:00:02.937 --> 00:00:07.607
A clinical note contains useful information, but the meaning is embedded in text.

00:00:07.607 --> 00:00:09.902
An image contains visual information.

00:00:09.902 --> 00:00:12.272
Audio contains signals over time.

00:00:12.272 --> 00:00:18.922
To analyze these sources, we usually need an extraction step such as NLP, computer vision, OCR,

00:00:18.922 --> 00:00:20.527
or speech processing.

00:00:20.527 --> 00:00:26.942
After extraction, some information may become structured features that can be analyzed alongside relational

00:00:26.942 --> 00:00:33.017
data. A useful project question is: what preparation step is required before analysis can even begin?

00:00:33.017 --> 00:00:37.662
A relational table may be ready for profiling, JSON may need flattening, and free text may need NLP or another

00:00:37.662 --> 00:00:41.337
extraction step.

00:00:41.337 --> 00:00:45.562
The form of the data changes the engineering path, but it does not by itself tell us whether the data is

00:00:45.562 --> 00:00:47.400
high quality.
